tools/nxc.py's Z80Snapshot, its .z80 reader, was written for this repository to give exactly what the
reader in Dean Woodyatt's NexClash gives (bleughb/nexclash, nexclash/z80tonex.py, class Z80Snapshot,
GPL-3.0-or-later, https://github.com/bleughb/nexclash): the same banks, version, 128K flag and 7FFD, and
the same reading of each register field. It follows that reader's structure and rules, so it is credited
here as derived from it, under the same licence as this repository, GPL-3.0-or-later. Copyright of
NexClash: Dean Woodyatt. tests/test_snapshot_reader.py compares the two.

The menu's font is not in this repository: a .nex that carries its menu copies it from the machine's own
ROM when it starts.
